ged\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2025-04-08\nValid as Of: 2025-04-08\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 1083 ---\nComponent: Kyma Runtime\nEnvironment: Kyma\nTitle: Regions: Europe (Netherlands) and Singapore (Jurong West)\nDescription: Europe (Netherlands) (cf-eu31) and Singapore (Jurong West) (cf-ap31 ), running on Google Cloud, are now available as new regions for use with enterprise accounts.  For more information, see Regions for the Kyma Environment and Provisioning and Updating Parameters in the Kyma Environment.\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: New\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2025-04-08\nValid as Of: 2025-04-08\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 1084 ---\nComponent: ABAP Environment\nEnvironment: ABAP\nTitle: Landscape Portal: Distributing Consumer Subscriptions\nDescription: With the new Manage Consumer Subscription app in the Landscape Portal, you can now control how consumers of your solutions are distributed among the available systems. See Manage Consumer Subscription.\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: New\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2024-12-05\nValid as Of: 2025-04-07\nVersion: ABAP Environment 2502\n\n--- Record 1085 ---\nComponent: UI Theme Designer\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry,Neo\nTitle: Theming Base Content for CF and Neo.\nDescription: The base theming content is updated to version 11.29.0. Review the changes at https://github.com/SAP/theming-base-content/releases.\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: New\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2024-01-01\nValid as Of: 2025-04-07\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 1086 ---\nComponent: API Management\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: Discover and Publish Events from Business Systems on Developer Hub\nDescription: You can now add events discovered from business systems to products and make them publicly available by publishing the associated products on Developer Hub. For mo